                                "sense_id": "8141c19c-0108-339a-ab5c-1ad033bd0fef",
                                "text": "Euarchos of Katane has no patronymic or pedigree, nor, though oecist of a secondary colony, is he associated with an oecist from the original metropolis, Chalkis."
                            },
