                                "example_id": "cf36205e-70ce-4571-a117-322f9aff3532",
                                "sense_id": "8141c19c-0108-339a-ab5c-1ad033bd0fef",
                                "text": "The most important local cult was the cult of the founder (oecist), which was connected to the historical event of the city's foundation in a given year."
